    "Shape": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "One semantic solid. Fields that a type does not use are ignored by the compiler.\n\nbox/rounded_box/plate: dimensions_mm [x, y, z]; rounded_box corner radius radius_mm.\ncylinder/tube/cone/capsule: radius_mm, height_mm along `axis`; cone top radius\n  radius_top_mm (0 = apex); tube wall wall_mm.\nsphere: radius_mm. ellipsoid: dimensions_mm are the three diameters.\ntorus: ring in the plane normal to `axis`; radius_mm (centre of tube), minor_radius_mm.\nwheel: axle along `axis` (default X); radius_mm outer radius, height_mm width,\n  wall_mm tyre thickness, spokes (0 = solid disc hub).\nextrude_profile: profile_mm points in the plane normal to `axis`, extruded height_mm,\n  centred on the origin.\nrevolve_profile: profile_mm points (radius, height) revolved about `axis` by angle_deg.\nloft: sections (polygons in the plane normal to `axis`) at section_heights_mm.\nsweep: circular profile radius_mm (or polygon profile_mm) along path_mm.\nshell: hollows its single child with wall_mm, optionally open on one face.\nboolean: children combined by `operation` (first child minus the rest for difference).\noccupancy: implicit-surface blend of primitive children with smoothing_mm, meshed at\n  pitch_mm; optional hollow shell of wall_mm. Visual or printable mesh, never STEP.\nmesh_reference: an imported mesh asset scaled to fit dimensions_mm.",
      "properties": {
        "angle_deg": {
          "default": 360,
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
          "maximum": 360,
          "title": "Angle Deg",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "asset_id": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "pattern": "^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_.-]{0,79}$",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Asset Id"
        },
        "axis": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "enum": [
                "X",
                "Y",
                "Z"
              ],
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Axis"
        },
        "children": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/Shape"
          },
          "maxItems": 64,
          "title": "Children",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "dimensions_mm": {
          "default": [
            20,
            20,
            20
          ],
          "maxItems": 3,
          "minItems": 3,
          "prefixItems": [
            {
              "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
              "maximum": 100000,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
              "maximum": 100000,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
              "maximum": 100000,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Dimensions Mm",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "frame": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Frame"
        },
        "height_mm": {
          "default": 20,
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
          "maximum": 100000,
          "title": "Height Mm",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "hollow": {
          "default": false,
          "title": "Hollow",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "minor_radius_mm": {
          "default": 2,
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
          "maximum": 100000,
          "title": "Minor Radius Mm",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "open_face": {
          "default": "none",
          "enum": [
            "none",
            "top",
            "bottom",
            "left",
            "right",
            "front",
            "back"
          ],
          "title": "Open Face",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "operation": {
          "default": "union",
          "enum": [
            "union",
            "difference",
            "intersection",
            "smooth_union"
          ],
          "title": "Operation",
          "type": "string"
